      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Let \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) be the two numbers. We are given that \\(x + y = 4xy.\\)\n\nNote that \\[ \\dfrac{1}{x} + \\dfrac{1}{y} = \\dfrac{x + y}{xy} = 4. \\]\n\nThus, C is the correct answer.",
